  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya Accountable Devolution Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to improved county capacity to deliver more and deliver better services.

Thereby the aim is to strengthen and create more accountable public institutions, improve local service delivery by overcoming performance barriers and enhancing citizen engagement. This is to make Kenya&apos;s sub-national governance (devolution) more responsive to citizen needs and priorities.

The implementing partner is the World Bank in Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
